- Dangerous sink: Yes (ois.readObject() on arbitrary deserialized data) (+25)
- No sanitization/validation: Yes, deserialization is performed before checking object type, and classpath contains unsafe custom readObject (+25)
- Reachable path: Yes, mapped to `/InsecureDeserialization/task` (+25)
Total score: 100/100

